		Node Cube
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 0.6 0.6 0.65
		Scale 2
	Component Physics
		Body Static
		ContactEvents true
		Shape Box
		HalfExtents 2 2 2
	Component GameStructure
		MeleeRadius 2
